{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a08b0d2a-3676-823d-ac82-efd883b40ec6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T13:17:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Yeah, um, my name is George Almy. I think I'm calling about a flooding problem, sort of a drainage thing, at 380 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 380 Coggeshall. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a parking lot behind the building, and I think it's graded wrong, or maybe the drain's clogged, because all the water runs right toward the back door. After that coastal storm, the one Friday into Saturday, it flooded the entrance. It's still, I think, partly under water now, three days later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days later, wow. So the water's pooling at the back door. Is it getting inside the building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:12-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sort of. It's coming right up to the threshold, maybe an inch of it getting in when it's bad. And this keeps happening. I think I've dealt with this every time it rains hard, and nobody ever does anything about the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, writing that down. Back lot, water running to the rear entrance, storm drain possibly blocked. Anything else I should note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the traffic. People cut through the lot and it's, I think, slowing to a crawl through the water. Cars are creeping along because nobody wants to splash through it. It's kind of a mess, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that makes sense. Is it a city drain or on private property, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think it's the city's, maybe? There's a grate at the low corner. I'm not totally sure, but it's always packed with leaves and sand. Last time I figured somebody would come clear it, and, well, nobody did."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a request so a crew can look at that grate and the drainage. After a storm like that they're backed up, so I can't tell you the exact day, but it'll be in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:16:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. I get that. I think it's just, you know, it's been a few days already. There's a kid down the street who sells lemonade every summer, and I swear he'd have this sorted faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:16:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll make sure they know it's the back lot at 380 Coggeshall. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0163. And can you have somebody call me back when it's done? I think I'd like to know it's actually been cleared, maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:16:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing, I'll note a callback to George at that number once the work is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:17:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Kevin. I appreciate it, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T13:17:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care."
    }
  ],
